---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Stack Build — AI Engineering & Development | Stack10"
  description="Senior AI engineers. Story-point pricing. Full IP transfer. Stack Build ships production AI in 6–8 weeks — no hiring, no stalled pilots, no lock-in."
  canonicalUrl="https://stack10.ai/services/build/"
>

  <!-- ── HERO ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="svc-hero hero-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-hero-inner animate-fade-up">
        <span class="section-label svc-hero-label">Stack Build</span>
        <h1 class="svc-hero-title">Ship production AI without hiring a team or burning another budget cycle.</h1>
        <p class="svc-hero-subtitle">Senior AI engineers on your project from day one. Story-point pricing — you know exactly what you're getting before a line of code is written. Full IP transfer when we're done.</p>
        <div class="svc-hero-actions">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Get Started
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── HOW WE'RE DIFFERENT ──────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">How we're different</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Not a consultant. Not offshore. Not a hire.</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Three categories of alternative — three reasons they fall short.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-diff-grid">

        <div class="card svc-diff-card">
          <div class="svc-diff-versus">
            <span class="svc-diff-label">vs. Big 4 &amp; Traditional Consultants</span>
          </div>
          <p class="svc-diff-statement">Every sprint closes with deployed software — not a strategy document, not a roadmap, not a recommendations slide.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card svc-diff-card">
          <div class="svc-diff-versus">
            <span class="svc-diff-label">vs. Offshore Dev Shops</span>
          </div>
          <p class="svc-diff-statement">Senior engineers only — no juniors on delivery, ever. Before a line of code is written, we validate the problem, the architecture, and the expected outcome.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card svc-diff-card">
          <div class="svc-diff-versus">
            <span class="svc-diff-label">vs. Hiring Internally</span>
          </div>
          <p class="svc-diff-statement">Faster to start, no recruitment overhead, no risk of a wrong hire. When the project is done, the IP is yours — and so is the institutional knowledge we leave behind.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ENGAGEMENT FORMATS ────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Engagement formats</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Two ways to engage</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Start with a Proof of Concept or move straight into continuous product delivery. Both formats use story-point pricing — you know exactly what's included before work begins.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Social proof callout -->
      <div class="svc-proof-callout">
        <div class="svc-proof-stat">98%</div>
        <p class="svc-proof-text">A PE-backed Australian healthcare group engaged Stack Build to ship four interconnected AI systems — an intelligence layer, a compliance agent, Xero reconciliation, and a procurement workflow. The result: <strong>98% reduction in manual compliance processing</strong> within the first quarter of operation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-tiers">

        <div class="card svc-tier">
          <div class="svc-tier-header">
            <div>
              <h3 class="svc-tier-name">Proof of Concept</h3>
              <p class="svc-tier-tagline">A working AI system on real production data, deployed in your environment.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="svc-tier-pricing">
              <span class="svc-tier-duration">6–8 weeks</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="svc-tier-list">
            <li>Working AI system built on your actual production data</li>
            <li>Deployed inside your own environment — not a sandbox</li>
            <li>Senior engineers only — no juniors on delivery</li>
            <li>Full IP transfer on completion, no retainer required</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="svc-tier-outcome">
            <span class="svc-tier-outcome-label">You walk away with:</span>
            <p class="svc-tier-outcome-text">A deployed, working AI system and full ownership of the codebase — enough to secure board approval, extend internally, or hand to Stack Build for the next phase.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card svc-tier svc-tier-featured">
          <div class="svc-tier-header">
            <div>
              <h3 class="svc-tier-name">Product Development</h3>
              <p class="svc-tier-tagline">Continuous delivery over months — full system design, architecture, and enterprise integrations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="svc-tier-pricing">
              <span class="svc-tier-duration">Monthly &middot; Ongoing delivery</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="svc-tier-list">
            <li>Sprint-based delivery — working software every two weeks</li>
            <li>Full system design, architecture, and technical ownership</li>
            <li>Enterprise integrations: SAP, Salesforce, Microsoft, legacy systems</li>
            <li>Data infrastructure and MLOps included</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="svc-tier-outcome">
            <span class="svc-tier-outcome-label">You walk away with:</span>
            <p class="svc-tier-outcome-text">A production AI product — fully integrated, documented, and yours. No vendor lock-in, no ongoing licensing fees, no dependency on Stack10 to keep it running.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Pricing note -->
      <div class="svc-pricing-note">
        <svg class="svc-pricing-note-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/></svg>
        <p>Pricing is story-point based — you know exactly what you're getting before a single line of code is written. No hourly billing. No scope creep surprises. Contact us for a custom quote.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── HOW WE BUILD ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-method-inner">
        <div class="svc-method-copy">
          <span class="section-label">How we build</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Four phases. Every engagement. No exceptions.</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Most AI projects stall because architecture is treated as an afterthought. We lock it first. Speed and security are not trade-offs — they are the result of a process engineered to remove the specific bottlenecks that slow down AI delivery. Story points locked before day one. Senior engineers only. Security architecture defined in week one, not week seven.</p>
          <a href="/how-we-build/" class="btn btn-outline">
            See exactly how we build
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-method-phases">
          <div class="svc-method-phase">
            <span class="svc-method-phase-num">01</span>
            <div>
              <p class="svc-method-phase-name">Architect First</p>
              <p class="svc-method-phase-weeks">Weeks 1–2</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-method-phase">
            <span class="svc-method-phase-num">02</span>
            <div>
              <p class="svc-method-phase-name">Core Build</p>
              <p class="svc-method-phase-weeks">Weeks 3–4</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-method-phase">
            <span class="svc-method-phase-num">03</span>
            <div>
              <p class="svc-method-phase-name">Integrate &amp; Harden</p>
              <p class="svc-method-phase-weeks">Weeks 5–6</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-method-phase">
            <span class="svc-method-phase-num">04</span>
            <div>
              <p class="svc-method-phase-name">Production Handover</p>
              <p class="svc-method-phase-weeks">Weeks 7–8</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 30/60/90 accountability callout -->
      <div class="svc-accountability">
        <div class="svc-accountability-inner">
          <span class="svc-accountability-label">The accountability framework</span>
          <p class="svc-accountability-text">Every Stack Build engagement includes structured review checkpoints at day 30 (architecture locked and validated), day 60 (core build complete), and day 90 (production-ready handover). You always know where you stand — and so do we.</p>
          <a href="/manifesto/" class="svc-accountability-link">
            How the 30/60/90 framework works across all Stack10 engagements
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── CAPABILITIES ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-caps-grid">
        <div class="svc-caps-copy">
          <span class="section-label">What we build</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Capabilities</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Stack Build covers the full AI engineering spectrum — from a rapid POC to complex agentic systems and customer-facing products.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="svc-caps-list">
          <li class="svc-caps-item">
            <span class="svc-caps-marker" aria-hidden="true">&mdash;</span>
            <span>Proof of concept on real production data</span>
          </li>
          <li class="svc-caps-item">
            <span class="svc-caps-marker" aria-hidden="true">&mdash;</span>
            <span>Internal AI tools and workflow automation</span>
          </li>
          <li class="svc-caps-item">
            <span class="svc-caps-marker" aria-hidden="true">&mdash;</span>
            <span>Agentic systems and autonomous process automation</span>
          </li>
          <li class="svc-caps-item">
            <span class="svc-caps-marker" aria-hidden="true">&mdash;</span>
            <span>Customer-facing AI products and features</span>
          </li>
          <li class="svc-caps-item">
            <span class="svc-caps-marker" aria-hidden="true">&mdash;</span>
            <span>Enterprise system integrations (SAP, Salesforce, Microsoft, legacy)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="svc-caps-item">
            <span class="svc-caps-marker" aria-hidden="true">&mdash;</span>
            <span>Data infrastructure and MLOps</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── RIGHT FOR YOU IF ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-fit-grid">
        <div class="svc-fit-copy">
          <span class="section-label">Is this right for you?</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Stack Build is the right engagement if&hellip;</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card svc-fit-box">
          <ul class="svc-fit-list">
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>You have board approval for AI investment but no team in place to execute it</span>
            </li>
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>A pilot has been running for months with nothing deployed — and the board is asking why</span>
            </li>
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>You've tried to hire senior AI engineers and found the talent pool too thin or too slow</span>
            </li>
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>You need a working POC in 6–8 weeks to demonstrate ROI and unlock the next budget cycle</span>
            </li>
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>An existing AI initiative has stalled — technically or strategically — and needs a reset</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── CTA ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-dark-block">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-cta-inner">
        <h2 class="svc-cta-title">Wondering whether we can actually deliver?</h2>
        <p class="svc-cta-desc">Fair question. Our answer is a Proof of Concept: six to eight weeks, working software on your data in your environment. If it doesn't work, you haven't committed to anything more. Most clients who start with a POC are in Product Development within ninety days.</p>
        <div class="svc-cta-guarantees">
          <span class="svc-cta-guarantee">Scope agreed before work starts</span>
          <span class="svc-cta-guarantee">Senior engineers only — no juniors on delivery</span>
          <span class="svc-cta-guarantee">Full IP transfer — everything built is yours</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
          Get Started
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── RELATED ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-related-header">
        <span class="section-label">Related services</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Before and after the build</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-related-cards">
        <a href="/services/discover/" class="card card-clickable svc-related-card">
          <div class="svc-related-card-tag">
            <span class="badge badge-secondary">Stack Discover</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="svc-related-card-title">Not sure what to build yet?</h3>
          <p class="svc-related-card-desc">Stack Discover surfaces the AI opportunities worth building before a line of code is written. Discovery in 2–4 weeks — so you arrive at Stack Build with a validated brief, not an assumption.</p>
          <span class="svc-related-card-link">
            Learn about Stack Discover
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/scale/" class="card card-clickable svc-related-card">
          <div class="svc-related-card-tag">
            <span class="badge badge-secondary">Stack Scale</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="svc-related-card-title">AI deployed. Now make it stick.</h3>
          <p class="svc-related-card-desc">Shipping software is step one. Stack Scale ensures your organisation actually uses it — measured adoption at 30, 60, and 90 days, with structured change management to close the gap between deployment and value.</p>
          <span class="svc-related-card-link">
            Learn about Stack Scale
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-hero {
    background: var(--gray-1000);
    color: var(--gray-50);
    padding: var(--space-24) 0 var(--space-20);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
  }

  .svc-hero-inner {
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .svc-hero-label {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, var(--size-6xl));
    font-weight: var(--weight-800);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    text-wrap: balance;
    color: var(--gray-0);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, var(--size-xl));
    font-weight: var(--weight-500);
    color: var(--gray-400);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .svc-hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .svc-hero-actions .btn-outline {
    background-color: var(--background);
  }

  /* ── How we're different ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-diff-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-diff-card {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .svc-diff-versus {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .svc-diff-label {
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-600);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--primary-text);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .svc-diff-statement {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    font-weight: var(--weight-500);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Social proof callout ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-proof-callout {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    background: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .svc-proof-stat {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--size-5xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-800);
    color: var(--primary-text);
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .svc-proof-text {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    align-self: center;
  }

  .svc-proof-text strong {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: var(--weight-600);
  }

  /* ── Engagement tiers ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-tiers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-tier {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-tier-featured {
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .svc-tier-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .svc-tier-name {
    font-size: var(--size-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-1);
  }

  .svc-tier-tagline {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .svc-tier-pricing {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
  }

  .svc-tier-price {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .svc-tier-duration {
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .svc-tier-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .svc-tier-list li {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    position: relative;
  }

  .svc-tier-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
  }

  /* Tier outcome block */
  .svc-tier-outcome {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .svc-tier-outcome-label {
    font-size: var(--size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--primary-text);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .svc-tier-outcome-text {
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Pricing note */
  .svc-pricing-note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    background: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-pricing-note-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .svc-pricing-note p {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── How we build teaser ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-method-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .svc-method-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .svc-method-copy .section-title {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .svc-method-copy .section-desc {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .svc-method-phases {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
